    {
      "id": "9Fai_MdKH1_8SEpsmRs2x",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5,
      "y": 105,
      "width": 1688,
      "height": 29.700000000000003,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2b",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1789397285,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1333133349,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791062185768,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What runs where, and how the parts talk. One operator scaffolds, runs the agents and merges; Kubernetes, Gitea, Agent Sandbox and Claude Code do the heavy lifting.",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r2",
      "originalText": "What runs where, and how the parts talk. One operator scaffolds, runs the agents and merges; Kubernetes, Gitea, Agent Sandbox and Claude Code do the heavy lifting.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "XN8kFMVx23Zte1yn93Yz7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 473,
      "y": 483,
      "width": 371,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2c",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1567988869,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 184893611,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791062185768,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The c4.factory.io/v1alpha1 kinds and\nAgent Sandbox's Sandbox. CEL rules in\nthe CRDs; an admission policy keeps each\nProject's name equal to its namespace.\netcd runs without fsync.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r32",
      "originalText": "The c4.factory.io/v1alpha1 kinds and Agent Sandbox's Sandbox. CEL rules in the CRDs; an admission policy keeps each Project's name equal to its namespace. etcd runs without fsync.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "NW67tVAy_-edpXuz93wHX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 473,
      "y": 891,
      "width": 356,
      "height": 76.95,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2d",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2079966181,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 57455493,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791062185768,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "server.mjs passes on GET requests under\n/apis/c4.factory.io only; health.mjs reads\npods, nodes and metrics.",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r39",
      "originalText": "server.mjs passes on GET requests under /apis/c4.factory.io only; health.mjs reads pods, nodes and metrics.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "haaFoNv2YGl5TgBP9bxhW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 993,
      "y": 483,
      "width": 484,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2e",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 977403717,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1032713035,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791062185768,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Reconcilers: Project, SoftwareSystem, Container,\nDataStore, Relationship, Session, Task, Crew. Talks to\nthe API server and to Gitea: its REST API, and Git over\nHTTP with in-memory clones. Runs up to 4 agent\nsandboxes at once.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r48",
      "originalText": "Reconcilers: Project, SoftwareSystem, Container, DataStore, Relationship, Session, Task, Crew. Talks to the API server and to Gitea: its REST API, and Git over HTTP with in-memory clones. Runs up to 4 agent sandboxes at once.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "49LYczbDwzj-_YRw3LuBK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1593,
      "y": 483,
      "width": 327,
      "height": 324,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2f",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 783011493,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 552991461,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791062185768,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SQLite on a 1 Gi volume.\n\nOrgs: templates, and one per project.\nRepositories, issues, labels,\nmilestones, pull requests, branch\nprotection and Actions.\n\nA seed Job creates the orgs, pushes\nthe templates at their tags and\nstores the tokens as Secrets. The\noperator adds one bot user per\nContainer.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r74",
      "originalText": "SQLite on a 1 Gi volume.\n\nOrgs: templates, and one per project. Repositories, issues, labels, milestones, pull requests, branch protection and Actions.\n\nA seed Job creates the orgs, pushes the templates at their tags and stores the tokens as Secrets. The operator adds one bot user per Container.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "W_ciAD3AExaPxNAuLyGCa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2017,
      "y": 483,
      "width": 282.1081081081081,
      "height": 51.300000000000004,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2g",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1206170117,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 229069291,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791062185768,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The minimal toolchain, for the e2e\nhello-world Container.",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r78",
      "originalText": "The minimal toolchain, for the e2e hello-world Container.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "OEh4TdTJtLJKs3VW4rD-k",
